    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Over a refined meal in Tokyo, industry veteran Ikezawa compliments Kuroki's taste, asks after her mother, and probes whether she intends to continue working as an actress, while Kawada pictures the chaos awaiting Muranishi's set. Let's listen in Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "すごくおいしいです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "君は素養があるね、違いが分かるってことは。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "で、お母さんはどんな様子かな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "落ち着いています。ご迷惑をおかけしました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
