      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is really delicious.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "君は素養があるね、違いが分かるってことは。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You have real refinement, being able to tell the difference.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "で、お母さんはどんな様子かな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So, how is your mother doing?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "落ち着いています。ご迷惑をおかけしました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She has calmed down. I'm sorry for all the trouble I caused.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "いや、我々の務めだからね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Not at all, it is simply our duty.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "そうですか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I see.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "ところで、君は女優を続けていくつもりなのかな？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'By the way, do you intend to keep working as an actress?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kuroki",
      "t": "それは、まだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, as for that...'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "この女優、どうやって口説いたと思う？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How do you think he persuaded this actress?'",
